<title>NEW ZEALAND: South Port sees slightly lower year net.</title>
<headline>South Port sees slightly lower year net.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Port New Zealand Ltd on Friday projected a group tax-paid profit of NZ$3.3 million for the full year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>South Port reported a $3.49 million profit in the previous full year.  </p>
<p>The company posted a 2.4 percent rise in half year net earnings to NZ$0.796 million from $0.777 million in the previous comparable period.</p>
<p>It said an operations review reduced permanent staffing with a one-off cost during the period.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
